{"articleNo":"368528","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=368528&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2022학년도 2학기 1차 국가근로장학금 학생 신청기간 안내[5.24.(화) ~ 6.23(목)]","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.05.18","hit":"14614","attachments":[{"name":"2022학년도 2학기 1차 국가근로장학금 학생신청 매뉴얼(홈페이지).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=368528&attachNo=112466"},{"name":"2022학년도 2학기 1차 국가근로장학금 학생신청 매뉴얼(모바일).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=368528&attachNo=112467"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">[2022</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학년도 2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학기 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">차 국가근로장학금 학생 신청기간 안내]</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2022</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학년도 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학기 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">차 한국장학재단 국가근로장학금 학생신청 일정을 다음과 같이 알려드리니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">참여를 희망하는 학생은 신청하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">신청기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: <b>2022. 5. 24.(</b></span><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">) 09:00 ~ 2022. 6. 23.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">) 18:00</span></b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">시까지&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">※ 주말 및 공휴일 포함 신청기간 내 24시간 신청가능(단, 시작일 및 마감일 제외)</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">신청대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: 2022-2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학기 국가근로장학사업 참여 희망 학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">신청방법&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">한국장학재단 홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">(www.kosaf.go.kr) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">및 모바일 앱을 이용하여&nbsp;신청(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">첨부파일 매뉴얼 참조)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">4.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">유의사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">희망근로기관 신청 및 선발 일정은 향후 학교 홈페이지 공고 예정   </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">- <b>2022학년도 동계방학 집중근로 프로그램</b>에 참여하고자 하는 경우, 반드시 2022학년도 2학기 학생신청 기간(1차 또는 2차)에 국가근로장학금을 신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">신청기간에 국가근로장학사업 참여 신청을 하지 않을 경우 국가근로 참여 불가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">사정 및 일정에 따라 변경 가능</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">붙임&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2022</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학년도 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">학기 국가근로통합신청 학생매뉴얼 각&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">끝</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"14896\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 0,\n\"dv\": 5,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.0\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"9, 1, 1, 5656\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\",\n\"as\": \"Windows_Unknown_Version\"\n},\n\"dis\": false,\n\"ds\": {\n\"ti\": \"\",\n\"la\": \"ko\",\n\"cr\": \"user\",\n\"su\": \"\",\n\"de\": \"\",\n\"cd\": \"2022-05-18T16:58:24.660Z\",\n\"md\": \"2022-05-18T16:58:24.694Z\",\n\"pd\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\",\n\"ke\": \"\"\n}\n},\n\"dh\": {\n\"do\": {\n\"pa\": 1,\n\"fo\": 1,\n\"en\": 1,\n\"pi\": 1,\n\"tb\": 1,\n\"eq\": 1\n},\n\"fo\": [ ],\n\"cd\": {\n\"tp\": 0,\n\"lc\": {\n\"af\": false,\n\"ui\": false,\n\"fu\": false,\n\"dn\": false,\n\"ul\": false,\n\"el\": false,\n\"at\"